{"unit_id":"DonnieTangzhili__dsh-ops-console#feature-1","repo":"DonnieTangzhili/dsh-ops-console","commit":"02427ca3db5b370169c993bedd5374c007800ff6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ops-console 的功能「检查版本」：用户在设置面板点击“检查更新”，插件对比 DSH 核心包和已安装插件的当前版本与 registry 中的最新版本，并在表格显示状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:65-74","lib/index.js:517-534"]}
