{"unit_id":"DonnieTangzhili__dsh-ops-console#feature-3","repo":"DonnieTangzhili/dsh-ops-console","commit":"02427ca3db5b370169c993bedd5374c007800ff6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ops-console 的功能「重启并自动重连」：用户点击“重启 DSH”后，Host 按当前进程的启动参数重新拉起 DSH，网页定时检查服务并在恢复后刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:125-145","lib/index.js:584-607"]}
{"unit_id":"DonnieTangzhili__dsh-ops-console#feature-4","repo":"DonnieTangzhili/dsh-ops-console","commit":"02427ca3db5b370169c993bedd5374c007800ff6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ops-console 的功能「停止 DSH」：用户确认停止后，插件终止当前 DSH 进程并在页面显示停止提示；此操作不会自动重新启动服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:178-199","lib/index.js:608-628"]}
